; GS Quant Architect v4.01 - Optimizer Pass 4 (PF >= 1.50)
; Goal: push strategy toward higher quality trades and PF-first behavior.
; Use Strategy Tester criterion = Custom max (uses OnTester PF floor logic).
;
; Format:
; parameter=value||start||step||stop||optimize

